      "content": "It is deeply challenging to think that your struggles might be \"coded\" into your DNA, but please remember that a family tendency for depression is a risk factor, not a life sentence. You are not doomed to give up because you can identify these patterns and seek help with them earlier in life. Many people discover that with the right treatment and self-compassion, they can break the cycle and live a life that is not just present, but flourishing.",
