    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it doesn't feel like a \"risk factor\" when you watch it happen over and over. it feels more like an inevitability. like, if the blueprint is already laid out, what's the point of all this effort to \"break the cycle\"? it just feels exhausting to fight something that's fundamentally part of who i am. sometimes it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable.",
