    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the different path is just more of the same? every time someone in my family tries to \"choose a different path,\" they just end up falling back into the same dark hole eventually. it feels less like a \"different path\" and more like just prolonging the struggle. if the end result is always the same, isn't it just more cruel to keep dragging it out?",
